            <div class="resume-row muted"><time>2025.03 — 2025.07</time><strong data-i18n="education.mit">MIT Online course</strong><span data-i18n="education.mitDetail">Artificial Intelligence: Scientific Data Analysis and Machine Learning Applications</span></div>
